# macOS / iCloud "conflicted copy" duplicates, e.g. "server 2.js", "api 3.js",
# "1756200000000_build9_extensibility 3.js". These have bitten deploys before:
# migrate.js loads EVERY *.js in migrations/, so a duplicate migration file runs
# as an extra migration. Never commit these — see DEPLOY.md "Migration gotchas".
* [0-9].*
* [0-9][0-9].*
